<DocsLayout title="Echophi — Rate limits">
  <h1>Rate limits</h1>
  <p>
    Each credential is limited to <strong>120 requests per minute</strong>. Responses include{" "}
    <code>X-RateLimit-*</code> headers; <code>429</code> includes <code>Retry-After</code>.
  </p>
  <p>
    Usage is audited in Govern (<code>GET /api/v1/partner/usage</code>) with page sizes 20 / 50 / 100 (max 100).
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
